  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mythic power gives you additional points in your ki pool.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Extra Ki<sup>CRB</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your ki pool increases by 3. Additionally, if your ki pool is empty, as a swift action you may expend two uses of mythic power to regain one ki point.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Unlike Extra Ki, you cannot take Mythic Extra Ki more than once.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-extra-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
